Fix this problem in `docs/install.md`.

Where: docs/install.md:5

Problem: ASC025 `variant-unknown`, an error
Message: `bun` isn't a value of `pm`; its values are: `npm`, `pnpm`, `yarn`
Allowed values: `npm`, `pnpm`, `yarn`
How to fix it: Use a dimension and value declared in `[dimensions]`, or declare them there.
Reference: https://ascribed-dev.com/reference/diagnostics/#asc025-variant-unknown
Line 5:
```markdown
@variant {pm=bun}:
```

When you're done, run `ascribe check docs/install.md` and fix what it reports.
